    "created_at": "2018-05-11T06:24:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-11T06:24:25Z",
    "body": "I can't speak for the other vendors, but we do at least. At least Firefox and Chrome have removed the features removed in SVG2 and updated to use href instead of xlink:href (as has Edge), and implemented new features such as paint-order, so I'd guess so.",
