    "created_at": "2018-05-11T14:18:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-11T14:20:39Z",
    "body": "This seems like a good plan to me. Let's be sure to reference https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/327 in the commit message.\r\n\r\n> The following features are defined in the SVG specification:\r\n\r\nThis list is driven by the tooling needs; you need to list dfns for everything that the HTML Standard references. And ideally you don't list anything that isn't cross-referenced. <del>So probably we'd need to list all the things that are currently referneced in both the SVG 1.1 and SVG Tiny parts.</del><ins>So we only need to reference the ones in the OP.</ins>",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
